      "structural_unit_id": "su-am-01",
      "segment_key": "AM.1",
      "title": "极乐国土",
      "content": "从是西方，过十万亿佛土，有世界名曰极乐。",
      "content_gloss": "Beyond many Buddha-fields lies the realm called Sukhavati.",
      "normalized_content": "从是西方 过十万亿佛土 有世界名曰极乐",
      "note": "sample/mock paraphrase",
      "position": 1,
      "char_count": 22,
      "metadata_json": { "is_mock_excerpt": true, "section": "pure-land" }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-am-002",
      "text_version_id": "tv-amituojing-kumarajiva",
      "structural_unit_id": "su-am-01",
      "segment_key": "AM.2",
      "title": "无有众苦",
      "content": "其国众生，无有众苦，但受诸乐，故名极乐。",
      "content_gloss": "That realm is characterized by freedom from suffering and abundance of joy.",
      "normalized_content": "其国众生 无有众苦 但受诸乐 故名极乐",
      "note": "sample/mock paraphrase",
      "position": 2,
      "char_count": 22,
      "metadata_json": { "is_mock_excerpt": true, "section": "pure-land" }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-am-003",
      "text_version_id": "tv-amituojing-kumarajiva",
      "structural_unit_id": "su-am-02",
      "segment_key": "AM.3",
      "title": "执持名号",
      "content": "闻说阿弥陀佛，执持名号，一心不乱，可为往生之门。",
      "content_gloss": "Single-minded recollection of Amitabha is presented as a path to rebirth there.",
      "normalized_content": "闻说阿弥陀佛 执持名号 一心不乱 可为往生之门",
      "note": "sample/mock paraphrase",
      "position": 3,
      "char_count": 26,
      "metadata_json": { "is_mock_excerpt": true, "section": "practice" }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-dc-001",
      "text_version_id": "tv-dhammacakkappavattana-cst4",
      "structural_unit_id": "su-dc-01",
      "segment_key": "DC.1",
      "title": "Two extremes",
      "content": "Dve me bhikkhave anta pabbajitena na sevitabba; ete ubho ante anupagamma majjhima patipada.",
      "content_gloss": "Two extremes are to be avoided; the middle way is taught instead.",
      "normalized_content": "dve me bhikkhave anta pabbajitena na sevitabba ete ubho ante anupagamma majjhima patipada",
      "note": "sample/mock condensed passage",
      "position": 1,
      "char_count": 104,
      "metadata_json": { "is_mock_excerpt": true, "section": "middle-way" }
    },
