      "content": "shes rab kyi pha rol tu phyin pa la brten nas sems la sgrib pa med do; de ltar na 'jigs pa med do.",
      "content_gloss": "Because one relies on prajnaparamita, the mind is unobstructed and free from fear.",
      "normalized_content": "shes rab kyi pha rol tu phyin pa la brten nas sems la sgrib pa med do de ltar na jigs pa med do",
